As promised last month, the latest version of cubes has been mailed out to
those that requested it.  Cubes, in case you don't know, is a single player
and multi-player dice game that can be played over a network (4.3 BSD UNIX).
Cubes is the game that makes the recently posted Yahtzee game look like the
pale imitator that it is.

If you're interested in receiving cubes and don't have version 3.1 yet,
you can send me electronic mail, and we'll figure out the best way to get
a copy to you.

